msgctxt "woh_ichi:1"
msgid ""
"Name: YUMIKO ICHIMURA\n"
"20 / FEMALE \n"
"When her twin brother suddenly disappeared during a family holiday, Yumiko swore to find him, no matter the cost..."
msgstr ""
"Name: YUMIKO ICHIMURA\n"
"20 / WEIBLICH\n"
" \n"
"Als ihr Zwillingsbruder während eines Familienurlaubs plötzlich verschwand, schwor sich Yumiko, ihn wiederzufinden, koste es, was es wolle …"

