msgctxt "woh_roku:212"
msgid "August 1971"
msgstr "August 1971"

#. Opción de «FOREST OF FEAR / TAPES OF TRAGEDY» (woh_roku:210). Opciones: August 1971 · October 1984 · March 1985 · CONTINUE · GOAL · find material for your project · uncover the truth and finish your documentary · reach the rescue team · remaining tape length · GO LEFT · GO UP · GO RIGHT · GO DOWN · REST A BIT · EXPLORE · Crushed to death.
msgctxt "woh_roku:213"
msgid "October 1984"
msgstr "Oktober 1984"

